2737", "title": "川普稱美軍已痛擊伊朗 可能進一步行動重申阻擁核", "date": "2026-10-23 07:42", "thumbnail": "https://pgw.udn.com.tw/gw/photo.php?u=https://uc.udn.com.tw/photo/t3/2026/10/23/35447437.jpg&M=1&s=Y&x=0&y=0&sw=1280&sh=853&exp=3600&w=300", "link": "/news/story/124061/9832737"}]}, {"name": "國際焦點", "articles": [{"article_id": "9834163", "title": "川馬通話…烏克蘭星盾提速 烏軍證實已改善", "date": "2026-10-24 00:00", "thumbnail": "https://pgw.udn.com.tw/gw/photo.php?u=https://uc.udn.com.tw/photo/t3/2026/10/23/35449642.jpg&M=1&s=Y&x=0&y=0&sw=1280&sh=853&exp=3600&w=300", "link": "/news/story/6809/9834163"}, {"article_id": "9834305", "title": "美第一夫人促成俄烏在奧列什基停火 川普：她想拯救孩童", "date": "2026-10-24 03:10", "thumbnail": "https://pgw.udn.com.tw/gw/photo.php?u=https://uc.udn.com.tw/photo/t3/2026/10/24/35449820.jpg&M=1&s=Y&x=0&y=0&sw=1280&sh=853&exp=3600&w=300", "link": "/news/story/6809/9834305"}, {"article_id": "9834105", "title": "美烏俄三方會談 下月重啟", "date": "2026-10-24 01:53", "thumbnail": "https://pgw.udn.com.tw/gw/photo.php?u=https://p.udn.com.tw/upf/2017_news/noimg_cid7225_5.jpg&w=300", "link": "/news/story/6809/9834105"}, {"article_id": "9834143", "title": "南韓首爾市長吳世勳涉「政治資金法」案證據缺乏 二審改判無罪", "date": "2026-10-24 00:04", "thumbnail": "https://pgw.udn.com.tw/gw/photo.php?u=https://uc.udn.com.tw/photo/t3/2026/10/23/35449629.jpg&M=1&s=Y&x=0&y=93&sw=924&sh=616&exp=3600&w=300", "link": "/news/story/6809/9834143"}, {"article_id": "9834172", "title": "美中台博弈／三強同桌 誰將淪為盤中餐？", "date": "2026-10-24 00:00", "thumbnail": "https://pgw.udn.com.tw/gw/photo.php?u=https://uc.udn.com.tw/photo/t3/2026/10/24/35449757.jpg&M=1&s=Y&x=0&y=0&sw=1231&sh=821&exp=3600&w=300", "link": "/news/story/6809/9834172"}]}, {"name": "世界萬象", "articles": [{"article_id": "9834254", "title": "約旦教堂爆槍擊釀6死28傷 槍手在喪禮期間開火", "date": "2026-10-24 01:40", "thumbnail": "https://pgw.udn.com.tw/gw/photo.php?u=https://uc.udn.com.tw/photo/t3/2026/10/24/35449774.jpg&M=1&s=Y&x=0&y=120&sw=283&sh=189&exp=3600&w=300", "link": "/news/story/6812/9834254"}, {"article_id": "9834032", "